### Rental Office
Marien enters Frio's freezing Rental Office, where he maintains sub-zero temperatures for his monthly cybernetic body maintenance. Return of her previously rented gear initiates a debate on technology: Frio advocates a techno-solutionist ideology, viewing mechanical augmentation as the ultimate evolution against biological decay and the looming solar flares, while Marien remains skeptical of his complete reliance on technology. Ignoring warnings of the upcoming solar storm, Frio insists his devices will endure and presents an updated list of rental tech:

- BlackShield Smart Glasses: Protects eyes from radiation and allows precise tracking of solar flare timelines.
- Under-Doctor Strap: Sub-dermal bio-strap that reduces fatigue during night exploration, though it triggers frequent health alerts.
- Quantum Dot Lenses: Enhances night vision and highlights path geometry.
- Actuator Belt: Mechanical joint support that increases movement speed and stability.
- VictoLab Toe-Robots: Micro-robotic attachments for absolute footing and silent movement.
- Keratin Polymer Grillz: Diamond denture set providing tactile bone-conduction feedback.

Marien selects a device to test Frio's claims, while Frio expresses confidence that her experience will gradually build her faith in technofixism augmentation.


### Community Garden
While spending time in the sunny garden, Marien and Heka encounter Hanino, an elderly Shaman holding a belled staff. Marien approaches her after recognizing that Hanino was the neighbor who recorded the backup voice message regarding the forest entity. Marien shows her the feather collected the previous night. Hanino instantly recognizes it as the mark of the Entity—a sun messenger her own spiritual mentor encountered decades ago, which triggered Hanino's own awakening as a medium.
When Marien shows a blank photograph taken of the Entity, Hanino touches the empty shadow on the screen and accurately recites the exact words the Entity spoke to Marien during the night. Hanino reveals that the Entity is currently resting inside a deep forest cave, waiting for its final flight. She invites Marien to join her on a nighttime expedition to the cave at 10 PM, promising that ancient records inside will reveal whether the upcoming solar flare brings humanity's doom or a new beginning, provided Marien brings the feather as a guide.
After Hanino leaves, Marien reflects on the mystical encounter, prepares herself for the upcoming night mission, and observes the sun before heading back inside with Heka to rest.


